From: jempa <jempamartensson@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:56:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 29/46] Dielectric: thin film on the interface (for hdPbrt)

"filmweight"/"filmthickness" (nm)/"filmeta" on the dielectric material: the
interface reflectance becomes Fresnel lerped with the exact spectral Airy
reflectance of a film on the outside (from inside, the matching outside
angle; TIR stays 1), and transmission takes 1 - R. R and T are spectra;
reflection/transmission sampling uses their averages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
